    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dive into multiple modes like career, quick fights, or local and online multiplayer. Whether you're chasing a belt or just throwing down with friends, Muay Mayhem brings tight, satisfying action that hits hard.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stand-Up Only Gameplay \u2013 Pure striking. No ground game, just hands, feet, knees, and elbows</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fighter Stats \u2013 Level up and customize your fighter\u2019s strengths and fighting style</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fight Settings \u2013 Adjust rules, difficulty, and round structure to your liking</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Character Customization \u2013 Change up your fighter\u2019s appearance and vibe</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Emotes \u2013 Taunt, flex, or celebrate mid-fight</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Game Modes</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Career Mode \u2013 Climb the ranks, earn rewards, and make a name for yourself</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Quick Fight Mode \u2013 Hop into a match instantly with no setup</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Player vs AI \u2013 Train or challenge smart computer opponents</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Local Multiplayer \u2013 Throw hands with friends on the same screen</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Online Multiplayer \u2013 Face off against players worldwide in real time</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Controls</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mouse &amp; Keyboard \u2013 Full support</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Controller \u2013 Partial support (improvements in progress)</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Developed by solo indie creator @TeepDev</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><br>Note: The Steam page may or may not be translated. The game itself is available in English.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
