        "notes": "Muay Mayhem is a competitive fighting game that recreates ring and cage matches inspired by the martial art of Muay Thai. It features stylized hand-to-hand combat, including punches, kicks, elbow and knee strikes, and knockouts. While there is no graphic gore, the game contains animated violence and intense physical action that may not be suitable for all audiences."
